.test-docs/

# results/, logs/, and .snakemake/ above are anchored to the repo root and
# don't cover the same directories nested inside .test_* fixtures (e.g.
# .test_bagel2/results/); ignore those at any depth too, so a run against a
# fixture can't accidentally get its generated output committed. resources/**
# stays root-only on purpose: fixtures' resources/ holds small, checked-in
# input data (library CSVs), not generated output.
**/results/**
**/logs/**
**/.snakemake
**/.snakemake/**
Rplots.pdf

# install_bagel2/install_drugz clone these fresh into resources/ at runtime;
# never meant to be committed (same reason resources/** is root-only above:
# don't blanket-ignore resources/, since fixtures' small input CSVs there
# are meant to be tracked).
**/resources/bagel2/
**/resources/drugz/
